      "bookIndex": 35,
      "hadithIndex": 3832,
      "bookHadithIndex": 72,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Uqbah bin 'Amir that the Messenger of Allah said:\"The expiation for vows is the expiation for an oath",
      "grades": [
