    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0aaa1",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 35,
      "hadithIndex": 3840,
      "bookHadithIndex": 80,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Imran bin Husain said:\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'There is no vow to commit an act of disobedience, and its expiation is the expiation for an oath",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3840-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Lighairihi"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3840-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3840-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0aaa2",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 35,
      "hadithIndex": 3841,
      "bookHadithIndex": 81,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Imran bin Husain, may Allah be pleased with him, said:\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'There is no vow to commit an act of disobedience, and its expiation is the expiation for an oath",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3841-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3841-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3841-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0aaa3",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 35,
      "hadithIndex": 3842,
      "bookHadithIndex": 82,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Imran bin Husain said:\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'There is no vow at a moment of anger and its expiation is the expiation for an oath",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3842-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3842-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3842-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0aaa4",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 35,
      "hadithIndex": 3843,
      "bookHadithIndex": 83,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Imran said:The Messenger of Allah said: \"There is no vow at a moment of anger and its expiation is the expiation for an oath",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3843-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3843-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3843-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0aaa5",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 35,
      "hadithIndex": 3844,
      "bookHadithIndex": 84,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Imran said:The Messenger of Allah said: \"There is no vow at a moment of anger and its expiation is the expiation for an oath.\" It was said: \"Az-Zubair did not hear this Hadith from 'Imran bin Husain",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3844-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3844-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3844-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0aaa6",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 35,
      "hadithIndex": 3845,
      "bookHadithIndex": 85,
      "text": "It was narrated from Muhammad bin Az-Zubair, from his father, from a man from the inhabitants of Al-Basrah, who said:\"I accompanied 'Imran bin Husain, who said: 'I heard the Messenger of Allah say: Vows are of two types: A vow that is made to do an act of obedience to Allah; that is for Allah and must be fulfilled, and a vow that is made to do an act of disobedience to Allah; that is for Shaitan and should not be fulfilled, and its expiation is the expiation for an oath",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3845-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3845-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3845-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0aaa7",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 35,
      "hadithIndex": 3846,
      "bookHadithIndex": 86,
      "text": "It was narrated that Muhammad bin Az-Zubayr Hanzali said:My father told me that a man told him, that he asked 'Imran bin Husain about a man who made a vow not to attend the prayers in the mosque of his people. 'Imran said: I heard the Messenger of Allah say: There is no vow at a moment of anger and its expiation is the expiation for an oath",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3846-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3846-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3846-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0aaa8",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 35,
      "hadithIndex": 3847,
      "bookHadithIndex": 87,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Imran bin Husain said:The Messenger of Allah said: \"There is no vow to commit an act of disobedience or at the time of anger, and its expiation is the expiation for an oath",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3847-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3847-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3847-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0aaa9",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 35,
      "hadithIndex": 3848,
      "bookHadithIndex": 88,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Imran bin Husain said:The Messenger of Allah said: \"There is no vow to commit an act of disobedience and its expiation is the expiation for an oath.\" Mansur bin Zadhan contradicted him in his wording",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3848-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3848-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3848-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0aaaa",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 35,
      "hadithIndex": 3849,
      "bookHadithIndex": 89,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Imran bin Husain said:The Messenger of Allah said: \"There is no vow for the son of Adam with regard to that which he does not possess, or to do an act of disobedience to Allah, the Mighty and Sublime.\" 'Ali bin Zaid contradicted him -for he reported it from Al-Hasan from 'Abdur-Rahman bin Samurah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3849-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3849-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3849-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0aaab",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 35,
      "hadithIndex": 3850,
      "bookHadithIndex": 90,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Abdur-Rahman bin Samurah that the Prophet said:\"There is no vow to commit an act of disobedience or with regard to that which the son of Adam does not possess",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3850-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Lighairihi"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3850-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3850-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0aaac",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 35,
      "hadithIndex": 3851,
      "bookHadithIndex": 91,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Imran bin Husain said:The Messenger of Allah said: \"There is no vow to commit an act of disobedience or with regard to that which the son of Adam does not possess",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3851-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3851-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3851-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0aaad",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 35,
      "hadithIndex": 3852,
      "bookHadithIndex": 92,
      "text": "It was narrated that Anas said:\"The Prophet saw a man being supported by two others and said: 'What is this?' They said: 'He vowed to walk to the House of Allah.' He said: 'Allah has no need for this man to torture himself. Tell him to ride",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3852-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3852-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3852-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0aaae",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 35,
      "hadithIndex": 3853,
      "bookHadithIndex": 93,
      "text": "It was narrated that Anas said:\"The Messenger of Allah passed by an old man who was being supported between two men and said: 'What is the matter with him?' They said: 'He vowed to walk.' He said: 'Allah has no need for him to torture himself. Tell him to ride.'\" So he was told to ride",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3853-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3853-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
