      "hadithIndex": 3854,
      "bookHadithIndex": 94,
      "text": "It was narrated that Anas bin Malik said:\"The Messenger of Allah came to a man who was being supported by two others and said: 'What is the matter with him?' It was said: 'He vowed to walk to the Ka'bah.' He said: 'Allah does not benefit from his torturing himself.' And he told him to ride",
