      "bookIndex": 35,
      "hadithIndex": 3855,
      "bookHadithIndex": 95,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"The Messenger of Allah said: 'Whoever swears an oath and says: \"If Allah wills, then he has made an exception",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-35-3855-abughuddah",
